Custom WordPress Theme – Landing Page & Blog
Overview
This project is a custom WordPress theme developed as part of an internship assignment. The theme includes a landing page layout and a blog page layout built using WordPress theme development practices.
The theme focuses on clean structure, responsive design, and SEO-friendly markup including structured data.
Features
•	Custom WordPress theme
•	Landing page template
•	Blog page layout
•	Responsive design for different screen sizes
•	Modular template structure
•	FAQ structured data implemented using JSON-LD inside template files
•	Clean HTML, CSS, and PHP structure
Tech Stack
•	WordPress
•	PHP
•	HTML5
•	CSS3
•	JSON-LD (for structured data / FAQ schema)
Theme Structure
Typical theme files included in the project:
Weight-loss/
│
├── style.css
├── functions.php
├── index.php
├── header.php
├── footer.php
├── weight-loss.php
├── single.php
│
├── assets/
       ├── css/main
   
Structured Data
FAQ structured data was implemented using JSON-LD embedded directly inside template files to improve SEO and enable rich results in search engines.
Installation
1.	Download or clone the repository.
2.	Copy the theme folder into the WordPress directory:
wp-content/themes/
3.	Log in to the WordPress admin panel.
4.	Navigate to Appearance → Themes.
5.	Activate the theme.
Purpose
This project was created as a learning exercise to practice:
•	WordPress theme development
•	Template structure and PHP integration
•	Responsive layout design
•	Implementing structured data using JSON-LD


